<title>GREECE: OTE TELECOM CHAIRMAN IN FYROM, EYES TELECOM.</title>
<headline>OTE TELECOM CHAIRMAN IN FYROM, EYES TELECOM.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>OTE telecom board chairman Dimitris Papoulias is visiting FYROM and will meet with government officials and discuss the country's plans to privatise its telecom, OTE said in a statement.</p>
<p>Papoulias will be briefed on privatisation procedures after talks with transport and telecommunications minister Aboumenaf Betzeti, finance minister Boris Rikalovski and FYROM telecoms general manager Risto Micov.</p>
<p>OTE along with Stet recently acquired a 49 percent stake in Telekom Srbija. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
